<h1>greeterHQ live documentation</h1>
<p>Requirements on <code>main</code> in each repo, the scenarios that verify them, and what each deployed channel achieved against the shared acceptance suite.</p>
<h2>Coverage</h2>
<dl>
<dt>Covered</dt><dd data-summary="covered"><%= summary[:covered] %></dd>
<dt>Uncovered</dt><dd data-summary="uncovered"><%= summary[:uncovered] %></dd>
<dt>Not yet recorded</dt><dd data-summary="not-yet-recorded"><%= summary[:not_yet_recorded] %></dd>
</dl>
<h2>Repos</h2>
<ul>
<%- repos.each do |repo| -%>
<li><a href="repos/<%= h(repo.name) %>.html"><%= h(repo.name) %></a> (<%= repo.requirements.size %> requirements)</li>
<%- end -%>
</ul>
<p>Last updated <%= h(built_at) %></p>
